          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Seventh People is our platform for finding new faces, talents and collaborators to work with around the world. Through our gallery of Polaroids we look to grow an extensive hub to showcase the people that make up our communities, contribute to our campaigns and brand activations. Ranging from Photographers, Models, Chefs and DJs we want to show the diversity of faces and backgrounds - whether it be from London, Japan or Paris you all make up the Seventh family.</p>"
